@client = http://localhost:5300
@productId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Politika yok
GET {{client}}/naive/{{productId}}

### Retry (exponential + jitter, 3 tekrar)
GET {{client}}/retry/{{productId}}

### Attempt timeout (1 sn)
GET {{client}}/timeout/{{productId}}

### Circuit breaker (yanıtta circuitState)
GET {{client}}/circuit-breaker/{{productId}}

### Circuit breaker durumu
GET {{client}}/circuit-breaker/state

### AddStandardResilienceHandler (override edilmiş ayarlar)
GET {{client}}/standard/{{productId}}

### Fallback (source: live | fallback)
GET {{client}}/fallback/{{productId}}

### Bulkhead (2 eşzamanlı + 1 kuyruk)
GET {{client}}/bulkhead/{{productId}}

### Hedging (300 ms sonra paralel deneme)
GET {{client}}/hedging/{{productId}}

### Gelen istek rate limiting (token bucket 5 / 10 sn) — 6. istekte 429
GET {{client}}/rate-limited
